00 guests, from **€15,000** — modern panoramic sunset views\n- **Hôtel de Crillon** (Place de la Concorde): 3 lounges totaling exactly **100 guests** — palace luxury (price on request)\n- **Musée Rodin** (7th arr.): up to **100 guests** — ceremony in a sculpture garden (price on request)\n- **Shangri-La Paris**: from **€15,000**, up to 250 — Eiffel Tower views from historic salons\n- **Peninsula Paris**: from **€18,750** (4.8★/73 reviews), sleeps 100 on-site\n\n## 💡 Final Recommendation\nFor the **best balance of price + capacity + reviews**, go with **La Fabrique République** (lowest cost, 5.0★) or **L\'Olivia** (unique Seine setting, 5.0★, €1,500–10k). If you want a show-stopping classic Parisian ballroom at a moderate venue fee, **Hôtel Le Marois** is the stand-out. Note that most Paris venues quote venue hire separately from catering (~€100–240+/person), so factor that into your total budget (typically €25k–45k for 100 guests in Paris).', name='search_venues', id='f507b56c-5377-4587-a40a-2a5c07353aa7', tool_call_id='call_a33ca3bd97934c3d9895675d'),
